{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>許志安《ON STAGE》演唱會將於2026年10月8日、9日、10日在紅磡體育館舉行，一連三場，今晚（10月8日）舉行頭場。許志安穿上風褸又跳又唱《學行》，之後瀟灑除下風褸和內搭的橙色背心，大騷為演唱會密密操練的強壯手臂肌肉！另外，唱到《請記住我》時，許志安以一身黑色西裝示人，深情演唱愛情中的淚，場面尤為動人！</p><figure><img alt=\"許志安穿風褸上台。（公關影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184988494939295744918605.jpeg/Am6a9yC4M_hm9eRyf1uihdTvPLeJg8XtpvrSdab60nU\"/><figcaption>許志安穿風褸上台。（公關影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"剝衫騷肌！（公關影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184988492703600640873950.jpeg/qCUlWBeD0Bb_dGIEaCwlthaXDRlHpJwrYR6G4mEehuI\"/><figcaption>剝衫騷肌！（公關影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"粗壯手臂！（公關影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184988490404990976260918.jpeg/fq1AwDQPTF9ZI2lRXauVXhh8AWGgKJa95h7yweYe8sE\"/><figcaption>粗壯手臂！（公關影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚仔！（公關影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184988487913443328084179.jpeg/PAuab99YnrCttQk9PqkG3IMEwFrA7HEsoJs47aCbOO0\"/><figcaption>靚仔！（公關影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"安仔穿西裝深情演唱。（公關影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184988485606445056932418.jpeg/GgzLS1mtNj5aOHrc6bCxbEHk6KpBEUJAZc13j2XNd48\"/><figcaption>安仔穿西裝深情演唱。（公關影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T14:20:29.255174+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":5,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}